Package: msTools
Title: Data-Focused Functions to Analyse Proteomics Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nico", "Hüttmann", , "huttmann.nico@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9321-2675"))
Description: Data-focused functions for analysing proteomics data, built on
    the on-disk storage that 'msArrow' provides. Contains an opinionated way
    to organise datasets as variables, observations and long data frames, an
    importer for DIA-NN reports, and helpers for plotting, string handling
    and code generation.
